{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51450","headline":"老僧续得贵妃袜（李羣玉同作） · 李远","name":"老僧续得贵妃袜（李羣玉同作）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坠仙遗袜老僧收，一锁金函八十秋。\n霞色尚鲜宫锦靿，彩光依旧夹罗头。\n轻香爲着红酥践，微绚曾经玉指构。\n三十六宫歌舞地，唯君独步占风流。\n（《青琐高议前集》六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}